DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
19273::$$$message_0153_0000_0000$$$::"Huh... Can't say I wasn't expecting this.[lr]::
19274::$$$message_0153_0000_0001$$$::So you took Saber down and made your way here..."::
19275::$$$message_0153_0000_0002$$$::"But what's the lad doing here?"::
19276::$$$message_0153_0000_0003$$$::"I guess you could say we met up along the way."::
19277::$$$message_0153_0000_0004$$$::"So is Lancer my last opponent? What a step down compared to Saber."::
19278::$$$message_0153_0000_0005$$$::"That's harsh, kid.[lr]::
19279::$$$message_0153_0000_0006$$$::I'll make you regret[line len=2]"[wvs]::
19280::$$$message_0153_0000_0007$$$::"Rage as you please, Berserker!"::
19281::$$$message_0153_0000_0008$$$::"[wacky len=6][line len=3]!!!"::
19282::$$$message_0153_0000_0009$$$::"Whoa, right off the bat!?"::
19283::$$$message_0153_0000_0010$$$::"You got it! Gáe...[move textoff=0 opacity=255 base=hf_バーサーカー-怒 cx=88 layer=0 py=123 px=125 affine=(124,185,+0.0,1,255,88,88)(127,301,3.691,1,255,88,88)(132,374,24.146,1,255,88,88)(133,331,10.954,1,255,88,88)(136,348,13.57,1,255,88,88) time=300 cy=88 mag=1 deg=+0.0 accel=0][se storage=se115.wav][wm canskip=0][se storage=se290.wav][hffacechg chara=ランサー face=驚 layer=1 time=200][hfchance layer=1] Guagh!"::
19284::$$$message_0153_0000_0011$$$::"Oh, well. That's all Lancer amounts to."::
19285::$$$message_0153_0001_0000$$$::"Now that the obstacle's out of the way, let's go, Big Brother. Oh, Berserker, you can leave now."::
19286::$$$message_0153_0001_0001$$$::"..."::
19287::$$$message_0153_0001_0002$$$::"Well, it's not like Lancer would die from that... [wait canskip=0 time=500][hffacechg chara=士郎 face=悩 layer=1 time=200][l][say storage=HIRI6_SHI_0040 _name=士郎]I think."::
19288::$$$message_0153_0001_0003$$$::"Hmph. He couldn't even serve as a scout. I suppose that's all spear fodder is good for."::
19289::$$$message_0153_0001_0004$$$::"Wow."::
19290::$$$message_0153_0001_0005$$$::"Is defeating a mere peon something to be so happy about, puppet?"::
19291::$$$message_0153_0002_0000$$$::"Lancer is the lowest among us. He doesn't even have any basic human rights."::
19510::$$$message_0153_0002_0001$$$::"...Well, give him some. He deserves that much."::
19511::$$$message_0153_0002_0002$$$::"...I don't like him, Shirou. I hate him as much as cats and cockroaches. Do something."::
19512::$$$message_0153_0002_0003$$$::"H-huh!? [hfsweat layer=1]What do you expect me to do?"::
19513::$$$message_0153_0002_0004$$$::"You beat him once before."::
19514::$$$message_0153_0002_0005$$$::"B-but I had Tohsaka to back me up before[line len=2]"::
19515::$$$message_0153_0002_0006$$$::"What, you can't beat him unless you do the dirty with Rin!?"::
19516::$$$message_0153_0002_0007$$$::"Hey! Don't talk about that so loud!"::
19517::$$$message_0153_0002_0008$$$::"Hmph! I can give you as much magical energy as you want. Hurry up and do something about him."::
19518::$$$message_0153_0002_0009$$$::"Do you have any idea what you're saying, Illya!?"::
19519::$$$message_0153_0002_0010$$$::"...Hm. I'm surprised you would have such desires for a child.[lr]::
19520::$$$message_0153_0002_0011$$$::And that's coming from me, a Saber enjoyer."::
19521::$$$message_0153_0002_0012$$$::"What's [font italic=true]that[font italic=false] supposed to mean!?[lr]::
19522::$$$message_0153_0002_0013$$$::[hfsweat layer=1]...Damn it, guess we gotta do this, then!"::
19523::$$$message_0153_0002_0014$$$::"Don't be in such a hurry to die, mongrel. Kotomine is on his way to pick up Lancer."::
19524::$$$message_0153_0002_0015$$$::"Oh, so the mighty King of Heroes is afraid to face us alone?"::
19525::$$$message_0153_0002_0016$$$::"Surely you aren't asking me to take up cards against the likes of you?"::
19526::$$$message_0153_0002_0017$$$::"...Is that why you were waiting for Lancer?"::
19527::$$$message_0153_0002_0018$$$::"What other reason would there be?"::
19528::$$$message_0153_0002_0019$$$::"...Sounds like Lancer's got it rough."::
19529::$$$message_0153_0002_0020$$$::"Thanks for waiting, Gilgamesh."::
19530::$$$message_0153_0002_0021$$$::"Dammit, it won't go this way next time..."::
19531::$$$message_0153_0002_0022$$$::"Lancer, that's a cliché that only losers say."::
19532::$$$message_0153_0002_0023$$$::"Hmph. Then I'll show you the difference between us. [hffacechg chara=ギルガメッシュ face=喜 layer=0 time=200][l][say storage=HIRI6_GIL_0100 _name=ギルガメッシュ]With my own two hands!"����